{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdqfBCX7RB2ZQNHyPMZL8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Fix Plan\n\n1. **Change**: Modify `golden/mapper.ts` to round the `irr` field to 9 decimal places (1e-9 tolerance) before serialization.\n   ```typescript\n   irr: Math.round(irr * 1e9) / 1e9\n   ```\n\n2. **Location**: `golden/mapper.ts`, in the serialization logic for projected records.\n\n3. **Rationale**: The deltas (1e-14 to 2e-13) are below the declared tolerance (1e-9) and stem from minor differences in floating-point arithmetic between Node 20 and 22. Quantizing to tolerance makes the snapshot portable across both versions.\n\n4. **Proof**: \n   - Regenerate the golden snapshot on Node 20: `npm run golden:snapshot`\n   - Commit the updated `golden/projections.json`\n   - Run CI on both Node 20 and Node 22 jobs\n   - Both should pass the golden gate"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":342,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":235,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
